# 6. Project Testing Phase

**Project Name:** FitBuddy – AI Fitness Plan Generator using Gemini Models

## Testing Objectives

* Check whether the application works correctly.
* Verify user input and workout plan generation.
* Test Gemini AI responses.
* Check nutrition and recovery tips.
* Test feedback-based plan updates.
* Verify user and plan data storage.

## Test Cases

| Test Case | Expected Result |
|---|---|
| Enter valid user details | Workout plan is generated |
| Generate workout plan | Personalized 7-day plan is displayed |
| Request nutrition tip | Nutrition/recovery tip is displayed |
| Submit feedback | Workout plan is updated |
| View all users | User and plan details are displayed |
| Open `/docs` | FastAPI API documentation is displayed |

